The '''Haynadurian calendar''' is a [[wikipedia:lunar calendar|moon calendar]] made of 18 months divided into 18 days, for a total of 324 days, making it shorter than the [[sunne]]an year by 7 days. Each month is divided into 3 weeks of 6 days. 

